---
title: "root (Osaka Fork: State Trie (Merkle Patricia Trie))"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_prepare: obj = _prepare_trie(trie, get_storage_root)
    q_prepare --> q_patricialize: root_node = encode_internal_node(patricialize(obj, Uint(0)))
    q_patricialize --> q_check_len: len(rlp.encode(root_node)) < 32
    q_check_len --> q_return_hash: True
    q_check_len --> q_return_root: False
    q_return_hash --> [*]: return keccak256(rlp.encode(root_node))
    q_return_root --> [*]: return Root(root_node)
    note right of q_return_root
        INV-020: Empty trie returns EMPTY_TRIE_ROOT (keccak256(RLP(b'')))
        INV-021: Root is always 32 bytes (either direct hash or keccak256 of short encoding)
        INV-022: root_node must be Bytes when >= 32 bytes encoded
    end note
